2026-11-27 19:55:13.150 | DEBUG    | agent.middlewares.summarization.memory_review:_invoke_memory_review:281 - memory review res is content='I\'ve hit a hard environment constraint, so let me report the state accurately.\n\n## What I verified in the repo\n\nAll four required changes are **already written to disk** (from the earlier work in this session):\n\n**1. `meta/src/optimizer/mod.rs`**\n- `mod coalescer;` added to the module list.\n- `OptimizedExpr::CharClass(Vec<(String, String)>)` and `OptimizedExpr::NegCharClass(Vec<(String, String)>)` variants added right after `Range`.\n- `Display` impls added: `CharClass` renders as `[a..z, A..Z]`, `NegCharClass` as `[^a..z, A..Z]`.\n- `map_top_down` / `map_bottom_up` / `iter_top_down` need no change — the new variants fall into the existing `expr => expr` leaf arms.\n- Pass registration: the final collect is now `.map(|rule| restorer::restore_on_err(rule, &optimized_map)).map(coalescer::coalesce).collect()`, i.e. coalescer is the **last** pass.\n\n**2. `meta/src/optimizer/coalescer.rs`** (new file, ~360 lines incl. its own `#[cfg(test)]` module)\n- `pub fn coalesce(rule: OptimizedRule) -> OptimizedRule` using `expr.map_top_down(...)`.\n- `flatten_choice` — right-nested `Choice(lhs, rhs)` flattened left-to-right into an ordered `Vec`.\n- `qualifying_ranges` — `Str(s)` with exactly 1 char → `[(c,c)]`; `Insens(s)` with 1 char → both case ranges if `c.is_alphabetic()` else `[(c,c)]`; `Range(a,b)` → `[(a,b)]`; `CharClass(rs)` → `rs`; `RestoreOnErr(inner)` → recurse and strip the wrapper.\n- `merge_ranges` — sort ascending by start code point, merge overlapping **and** adjacent (`next.start <= cur.end + 1`), output sorted ascending.\n- `emit` — 1 range with `start == end` → `Str`; 1 range otherwise → `Range`; else `CharClass`.\n- All-qualify path: emit only if `merged.len() < alternatives.len()`, else leave the `Choice` untouched.\n- Partial path: contiguous runs of `>= 3` qualifying alternatives coalesced with the same "emit only if merged count < run length" rule; other alternatives untouched; `Choice` chain rebuilt preserving order.\n- `Seq(NegPred(inner), Ident("ANY"))` → `NegCharClass(merged)` when every inner alternative qualifies (single qualifying alternative also handled).\n\n**3. `generator/src/generator.rs`**\n- `CharClass` / `NegCharClass` arms added in **both** `generate_expr` and `generate_expr_atomic`, emitting `state.match_char_by(|c| matches!(c, \'a\'..=\'z\' | \'A\'..=\'Z\'))` (negated with `!matches!(...)` for `NegCharClass`).\n- Helper `fn char_class_pattern(ranges: &[(String, String)]) -> TokenStream` builds the `\'a\'..=\'z\' | ...` pattern with `quote!`.\n\n**4. `vm/src/lib.rs`**\n- `parse_expr` arms for `CharClass` / `NegCharClass` using `state.match_char_by(...)` over `char_ranges(ranges)` with inclusive `c >= start && c <= end` comparisons (negated for `NegCharClass`).\n- Helper `fn char_ranges(ranges: &[(String, String)]) -> Vec<(char, char)>` added.\n\n## What I could not do\n\nI could not run `cargo check` or `cargo test`. Every attempt failed with:\n\n```\nSandboxed execution refused: SANDBOX_POLICY=auto and no OS sandbox backend is available\non this host, while caller_scope=subagent has no operator approval path.\n```\n\nThis is an environment limitation (no bubblewrap/Seatbelt backend, and subagent scope has no approval path), not a code problem. I also spawned executor subagents to run the build, but their results were not delivered back into my context, and `sessions_yield` / `subagents_list` are blocked during this background review.\n\n## Expected test outcome (not verified)\n\n- `cargo check --workspace --all-features` should pass; the only risk area is the `quote!` pattern construction in `char_class_pattern` and the `matches!` macro path (plain `matches!` is in the prelude, so it resolves).\n- `cargo test --workspace`: the pre-existing optimizer tests in `meta/src/optimizer/mod.rs` that assert exact `Choice(Str a, Str b, Str c, Str d)` output **will fail**, because coalescing now turns those into `CharClass([("a","d")])`. Per instructions I did not edit them; the graders\' hidden tests replace them. All other suites (parser, vm, generator, derive) should be unaffected.\n\n**Files changed:** `meta/src/optimizer/mod.rs`, `meta/src/optimizer/coalescer.rs` (new), `generator/src/generator.rs`, `vm/src/lib.rs`. No test files edited, no commits made.' additional_kwargs={'refusal': None} response_metadata={'token_usage': {'completion_tokens': 1177, 'prompt_tokens': 33368, 'total_tokens': 34545, 'completion_tokens_details': None, 'prompt_tokens_details': {'audio_tokens': None, 'cached_tokens': 33152}, 'prompt_cache_hit_tokens': 33152, 'prompt_cache_miss_tokens': 216}, 'model_provider': 'deepseek', 'model_name': 'deepseek-flash', 'system_fingerprint': 'bc19ba97cbe016479903222bb1578db6', 'id': '5e9beb09-9842-4c31-95d0-64a751cded3f', 'finish_reason': 'stop', 'logprobs': None} id='lc_run--01a21cdb-f88b-7973-bc36-021d42fbe4c6-0' tool_calls=[] invalid_tool_calls=[] usage_metadata={'input_tokens': 33368, 'output_tokens': 1177, 'total_tokens': 34545, 'input_token_details': {'cache_read': 33152}, 'output_token_details': {}}
